==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Manager Cat & Clerk Cat (Enemy)|Manager Cat & Clerk Cat]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

